ial in so many ways. The combination is a perfect visual for kids to better understand and learn the beginning sounds! You can use them with a letter of the week curriculum, as anchor charte, summer learning, alphabet posters, or compile into a fun-to-read alphabet book for preschool, prek, or kindergarten. One sang by Sesame Street characters and the other sang by Usher.\nNow, thanks to some simple exercises, my range has increased, I hit higher notes, and I feel less strain in my voice and notes that were once impossible to reach are now easy to sing. She has worked in profit and non-profit programs, high-risk schools, as well as her in-home preschool. Included are 15 songs to help children learn the days of the week, months of the year, alphabet, phonics, opposites, colors, shapes and much more! It also includes: class book of letter pictures, roll and race game, alphabet buses, alphabet flash cards, and much more! These songs are great for Pre-K, Preschool, and Kindergarten. Goat starts with G, g-g goat. Make learning fun with this collection of popular classic favorites, activity songs, and nursery rhymes with a splash of original tunes! Bear starts with B, b-b bear. And ostrich starts with O, o-o ostrich. I often use Alphabet song videos in my","tokens":["When"," children"," like"," a"," certain"," character"," or"," group"," of"," characters",","," it"," can"," help"," encourage"," them"," to"," want"," to"," learn","."," Learning"," letters"," and"," their"," sounds"," will"," help"," you"," learn"," to"," read","."," Pig"," starts"," with"," P",","," p","-p"," pig","."," Jack"," Hart","mann"," has"," many"," alphabet"," songs",","," but"," this"," is"," probably"," our"," absolute"," favorite"," that"," works"," on"," letter"," recognition"," and"," letter"," sounds","."," Rabbit"," starts"," with"," R",","," r","-r"," rabbit",".\n","And"," Z","ebra"," starts"," with"," Z",","," z","-z"," z","ebra","."," This"," is"," a"," perfect"," indoor"," activity"," w