hijau gelap itu pun dikarenakan daun katuk mempunyai kadar klorofil yang tinggi. Wow banyak sekali ya kandungan bermanfaat yang dimiliki oleh daun katuk.\nNah, biasanya, para ibu memanfaatkan daun katuk dengan diolah menjadi sayur ataupun jus. Lebih lanjut lagi nih kita intip manfaat dari daun katuk.\nBeberapa Manfaat dari daun katuk:\n- Daun katuk dipercaya dapat melancarkan ASI\n- Daun katuk dapat mencegah osteoporosis\n- Daun katuk mengandung efedrin bagi penderita influenza\n- Daun katuk kaya akan senyawa yang mampu membantu meningkatkan serta membangkitkan vitalitas pria dan wanita.\n- Daun katuk merupakan sumber vitamin A yang berguna untuk mencegah penyakit mata, pertumbuhan sel, sistem kekebalan tubuh, reproduksi, dan menjaga kesehatan kulit.\n- Daun katuk berperan sebagai senyawa utama tubuh untuk pembuatan kolagen, pengangkut lemak, pengangkut elektron,pengatur tingkat kolesterol, serta pemacu imunitas. Dan juga untuk meningkatkan fungsi otak supaya dapat bekerja dengan maksimal.\n- Daun katuk kaya akan klorofil yang dapat membersihkan jaringan tubuh dan tempat pembuangan sisa metabotisme, mengatasi kuman atau bakteri, serta virus yang berada didalam tubuh.\n- Daun katuk dapat digunakan sebagai pelangsing tubuh.\n- Daun katuk dapat menanggulangi anemia karena dengan kandungan zat besi yang dimiliknya. Setiap 100 gam daun katuk mengandung sekitar 2,7 mg zat besi.\n- Daun katuk mencegah dan memperbaiki ganguan reproduksi pada pria dan wanita.\n- Daun katuk menghambat penyakit jantung serta ganguan pada pembuluh darah.\nItualh manfaat-manfaat dari daun katuk, selain manfaatnya yang sudah dikenal luas sebagai tumbuhan yang berkhasiat ternyata mempunyai efek samping daun katuk jika tidak hati-hati dalam mengkonsumsinya.\nEfek Negatif Daun Katuk\nBahaya daun katuk dengan mengkonsumsi sebanyak 150 gram mentah selama 2 minggu sampai 7 bulan, dapat mengakibatkan efek samping seperti sulit tidur dan sesak nafas yang mengganggu Anda.\nHal semacam ini pernah terjadi di Negara Taiwan dimana saat 44 orang mengkonsumsi jus daun katuk mentah selama 7 bulan.\nNamun setelah pemakaian dihentikan selama 40-44 hari gejala tersebut berangsur-angsur menghilang. Bahkan pada level pengkonsumsian selama 22 bulan diketahui dapat menyebabkan gejala bronchitis.\nMenurut penelitian pada tahun 1995, masyarakat di negara Amerika mengkonsumsi daun katuk goreng dan salad daun katuk sebagai obat antiobesitas.\nSetelah dilakukan penelitian pada 115 kasus bronchitis, diketahui bahwa pasien yang rata-rata berumur 22-66 tahun sebelumnya banyak mengkonsumsi daun katuk, waduh gawat ju","tokens":["Ef","ek"," Neg","atif"," Da","un"," Kat","uk"," –"," Ber","bagai"," man","fa","at"," dari"," da","un"," kat","uk"," sudah"," kita"," ket","ah","ui",","," salah"," sat","unya"," yak","ni"," da","un"," kat","uk"," merupakan"," salah"," satu"," tan","aman"," yang"," dapat"," dig","unakan"," sebagai"," pel","anc","ar"," AS","I"," bagi"," ib","u"," yang"," sed","ang"," meny","us","ui","."," Da","un"," kat","uk"," meng","and","ung"," h","amp","ir"," ","7"," %"," protein"," dan"," ","1","9"," %"," ser","at",".\n","Da","un"," kat","uk"," k","aya"," akan"," vitamin"," K",","," B",","," C"," dan"," beta"," kar","oten","."," Da","un"," kat","uk"," juga"," meng","and","ung"," k","als","ium",","," z","at"," bes","i",","," kal","ium",","," fos","for",","," dan"," magnesium",".\n","Warn","a"," da","un","nya"," yang"," hij","au"," gel","ap"," itu"," pun"," dik","aren","akan"," da","un"," kat","uk"," mem","pun","y","ai"," kadar"," k","lor","ofil"," yang"," ting","gi","."," Wow"," banyak"," sek","ali"," ya"," k","and","ungan"," b","erman","fa","at"," yang"," dim","iliki"," oleh"," da","un"," kat","uk",".\n","N","ah",","," bias","anya",","," para"," ib","u"," mem","an","fa","at","kan"," da","un"," kat","uk"," dengan"," di","olah"," menjadi"," say","ur"," ata","up","un"," jus","."," Le","bih"," lan","j","ut"," lagi"," n","ih"," kita"," int","ip"," man","fa","at"," dari"," da","un"," k