 belajar seperti kotak alat tulis, laptop atau komputer bberapa aksesoris pajanagan biar tampilan pada tempat tidur ini terlihat lebih cantik . Untuk produksi tempat tidur tingkat ini tidak perlu diragukan lagi kualitasnya, karena dibuat dengan bahan kayu yang solid yang sudah jelas kualitasnya. Juga untuk tempat tidur tingkat ini bisa dipakai dalam jangka waktu yang cukup panjang, bahkan mungkin bisa seumur hidup.\nBagaimana cukup ringkas bukan denganfurniturekamar buah hati anda… yuk segeraa miliki tempot tidur tingkt dengn meja belajar ini.. Caranya cukup mudah dengan menghubungi nomor yang telah tertera pada web ini dan kirim gambar tersebut lewat wa / bm . Selin tempat tidur dengan meja belajar kami juja punya macam tempat tidur seperti : tempat tidur tingkat, tempat tidur sorong. Terimakasih . 🙂","tokens":["Temp","at"," tid","ur"," merupakan"," sebuah"," temp","at"," yang"," p","aling"," ny","aman"," untuk"," ber","ist","ir","ah","at","."," Di"," temp","at"," tid","ur"," Anda"," bias","anya"," mere","bah","kan"," bad","an"," Anda"," me","le","pas"," pen","at"," set","elah"," seh","arian"," ber","aktiv","itas"," dan"," meng","ist","ir","ah","atk","annya"," set","elah"," seh","arian"," ber","aktiv","itas","."," M","aka"," itu"," per","lu"," temp","at"," tid","ur"," yang"," baik",","," karena"," temp","at"," tid","ur"," yang"," baik"," akan"," ter","ci","pta"," r","asa"," ny","aman"," dan"," dapat"," meng","ob","ati"," r","asa"," le","lah"," karena"," ber","aktiv","itas","."," Temp","at"," tid","ur"," se","ba","ik","nya"," did","es","ain"," sen","y","aman"," m","ungkin"," untuk"," mend","uk","ung"," ist","ir","ah","at"," Anda"," lebih"," ef","ekt","if"," dan"," juga"," r","ile","ks","."," J","ika"," Anda"," memiliki"," anak"," dengan"," k","amar"," yang"," ter","bat","as"," di"," rum","ah"," Anda",","," temp","at"," tid","ur"," ting","kat"," dapat"," menjadi"," p","ilihan"," tep","at","."," D","engan"," ad","anya"," temp","at"," tid","ur"," ini"," dengan"," tamb"